{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51440","headline":"白鹿寺释迦瑞相诗 · 裴休","name":"白鹿寺释迦瑞相诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无相无亏有相圆，多生檀越种因缘。\n三千境见阎浮土，丈六身留兜率天。\n绀目辉腾沧海月，玉毫光射宝炉烟。\n道人参到非非处，不是丹霞破佛禅。\n（《同治湖南通志》二三八《方外志·寺观·益阳县》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51440.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51440","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}